      "category": "Text",
      "text": "the City Administrator may prescribe: Provided, That to the extent such information is within the exclusive possession of a labor union or an agency referring workers or providing or supervising apprenticeship or training, and such labor union or agency shall refuse to furnish such information to the contractor, the contractor shall so certify to the contracting agency as part of his Compliance Report, and shall set forth what efforts he has made to obtain such information.",
